    "selector": "/problems/4/inferred_spec"
   }
  ]
 },
 "contentScope": "authored",
 "requirements": {
  "status": "present",
  "value": [
   "ALSWrapper() starts with no readings.",
   "record(status, lux, timestamp) stores the reading (timestamp, lux) when status is 1 and ignores it completely when status is 0; readings from several sensors may arrive out of timestamp order.",
   "getLatestLux() returns the lux of the stored reading with the largest timestamp, the most recently recorded one among equal timestamps, or -1 when nothing is stored.",
   "getAverageLux(startTime, endTime) returns the floor of the mean lux over stored readings with startTime <= timestamp <= endTime, or -1 when there are none.",
   "Every method call is answered in call order on one instance; void methods return nothing."
  ],
